window.products.push({"id":741083,"name":"Pendleton Big Medicine Blanket, Chive, Twin","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":299.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81I7kmdfckL._AC_SL1334_.jpg","description":"The robe-sized blanket, from Pendleton, is the size preferred by Native Americans for ceremonial purpose and wrapping about oneself like a robe. 82% pure virgin wool and 18% cotton. Felt bound. Size 64\" x 80\". Pendleton Big Medicine Robe Blanket: The rare white bison occurs only once in every 1 million births. In 1933, a white buffalo was born in the wild on Montana's Flathead Indian Reservation and was called \"Big Medicine\" to reflect his sacred power. Many Native American tribes consider the return of the White Buffalo the fulfillment of an ancient prophecy and the beginning of a new era for the peoples and Mother Earth. Tradition spoke of the coming of a herd of pure White Buffalo. The seven bison on this blanket represent the seven directions: North, South, East, West, Above, Below and Within. Together they symbolize wholeness for mankind and the earth. Prayer pipes signify mankind's communication with the Creator. In the center of the blanket, within the circle of life, are four hands representing the diverse peoples of the world and a new beginning. Shades brown and green reflect the natural beauty of Mother Earth.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81I7kmdfckL._AC_SL1334_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pendleton","source_asin":"B005MKR4QQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-741083","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B005MKR4QQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B005MKR4QQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
