window.products.push({"id":741089,"name":"Cardinal Christmas Ornament- Cardinal on a Branch Christmas Tree Ornament- Hanging Figurine Ornament Christmas Decoration","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81mUNPO-jiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Put a uniquely “you” touch on your family Christmas tree with Holiday Treasures cardinal Christmas ornamentDecorating a Christmas tree is one of the most special traditions of the festive season. Having memorable ornaments to commemorate milestones or the special people in your life adds to the fun and memories. Whether you’re trying to capture a moment or message, with our cardinal ornaments for Christmas, you can celebrate your life’s special moments. Add this decorative Christmas ornaments to your Christmas tree, living room or mantle to give your home a much-needed festive touch.Features:- Easy hanging: Comes with a beautiful ribbon, so they are ready to hang right out of the box.- Make your holiday memories last for years: Our cardinal Christmas tree ornaments are made of premium quality resin that’s durable & lightweight.Give them a gift they’ll remember & cherishLooking for a present that stands out? What’s better than our one-of-a-kind Christmas ornament. Everyone loves a gift that’s made by hand and something that comes from the heart. Give your loved ones our red cardinal Christmas ornament and spread the holiday cheer. It is the perfect keepsake present and stocking stuffer for your family, neighbors, friends, church members and grandparents.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81mUNPO-jiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Holiday Treasures","source_asin":"B09FCLKFWM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-741089","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09FCLKFWM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09FCLKFWM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":741090,"name":"O Captain My Captain Walt Whitman Poster 11x14\" Poetry Wall Decor, Unframed Poem Art Poster for Home, Office, Classroom, Library. Typography Gift For ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91TTpOad2kL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"O Captain! my Captain! our fearful trip is done, The ship has weather’d every rack, the prize we sought is won, The port is near, the bells I hear, the people all exulting, While follow eyes the steady keel, the vessel grim and daring; But O heart! heart! heart! O the bleeding drops of red, Where on the deck my Captain lies, Fallen cold and dead.  O Captain! my Captain! rise up and hear the bells; Rise up—for you the flag is flung—for you the bugle trills, For you bouquets and ribbon’d wreaths—for you the shores a-crowding, For you they call, the swaying mass, their eager faces turning; Here Captain! dear father! This arm beneath your head! It is some dream that on the deck, You’ve fallen cold and dead.  My Captain does not answer, his lips are pale and still, My father does not feel my arm, he has no pulse nor will, The ship is anchor’d safe and sound, its voyage closed and done, From fearful trip the victor ship comes in with object won; Exult O shores, and ring O bells! But I with mournful tread, Walk the deck my Captain lies, Fallen cold and dead. by Walt Whitman ORIGINAL - Bring a unique artwork to any room or office decorations GIVE JOY - This beautifully scripted O Captain My Captin Whitman poem wall art print will be a delightful addition to any room is an ideal decor gift MAKES A WOW GIFT - This unique Invictus print will be loved by all who appreciate inspirational wall art READY TO FRAME - You get one 11\"x 14\" high quality wall print. You can easily buy a frame to match your decor here on Amazon or at any local department store GUARANTEED WILL LAST A LIFETIME - The picture is printed on Archive paper to make a heritage gift that will not discolor or fade","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91TTpOad2kL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Joy For All Art","source_asin":"B0851923T8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-741090","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0851923T8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0851923T8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
