window.products.push({"id":741195,"name":"Easter Bunny One Letter Sign Some Bunny Is One Birthday Party Decorations Cake Smash Supplies Freestanding Paper Mache Number Sign","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71FUxxXwkCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"EASTER FIRST BIRTHDAY DECORATIONS -- The package comes with 1 set of bunny one letter signs, 1pc um-assembled bunny ears, 1pc bunny tail, 3pcs artificial flowers, and 20pcs glue dots. Stand the letters on a party table or use it as a backdrop prop in your baby pictures - so cute! After the day, they will be also great keepsakes. LARGE FREESTANDING ONE LETTERS -- Each letter sign is 9.8 inches tall, 6.7 inches wide, and 1.6 inches thick. They stand on their own, or you could add hooks/hanging tape to hang on a wall. Perfect for your little bunny’s first birthday cake smash, milestone party, and nursery decor photo shoot. PRIME QUALITY PARTY SUPPLIES -- The letters are made of thick paper mache, back and sides are painted as well. And the letter ‘N’ is made of high-quality gold glitter cardstock, with no shedding. WIDELY APPLICATION -- Is your little bunny turning one this year? Our bunny ONE sign will, without a doubt, be the talk of your little one's first birthday party. It can make a great centerpiece for a birthday party or cake table decoration but can also be used as nursery decor after the party! SATISFACTION SERVICE -- If you have any questions about our Easter bunny one letter sign, please feel free to contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71FUxxXwkCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Distaratie","source_asin":"B0BM3TMR8P","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-741195","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BM3TMR8P","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BM3TMR8P","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":741196,"name":"As Seen On TV, FAAY Spurtles Set of 4, Natural Kitchen Utensils for Cooking, Mixing, Salad Serving, 100% Handmade from High Moist Resistance Real Teak","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81JPnC7zTKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"100% CAREFREE COOKING EXPERIENCE Our FAAY Teak Spurtle Set are made of 100% golden brown teak. They are lightweight and handy. The handle is designed to be comfortable to hold. They can spread, cook, mixed and scrape; compatible with pots, pan, baking tray, ceramic dishware. The angled edge also easily gets to the corner of your cookware effortlessly. The smooth curved edges of wood spoons make them ideal to use with Teflon coated and delicate finish pots and woks. 100% HEALTHY AND ECO-FRIENDLY Our FAAY Teak Spurtles are from sustainable source of teaks in Thailand. Teaks are well known to be heat and moist resistant. Please be noted that the product color depends on types of soil (it can be either dark or light golden brown). No glue or lacquer added, only coconut oil finished. This is just to ensure our valuable customers good health. 100% HANDMADE AND HEARTCRAFTED BY LOCAL ARTISANS Most of the wooden utensils nowadays are machinemade. Every piece of our products helps the local artisans maintain their remarkable craft skill and pass it down to the next generations. They are genuine artists, and they just need a little space to express their talent. Only you can provide them with that. 100% EASY TO TAKE CARE Wash them with warm water and soft sponge to preserve their qualities. We recommend you dry them by hanging. If there is something sticking to our spoons, just put them in the water for 5 minutes before washing. Please store them in dry place when not used. When teak products are exposed to oil and heat, their color normally becomes darker, but they are still perfectly useable. Oil them occasionally when feel dry to prevent crack. 100% WARRANTY GUARANTEED In case our spurtles do not come in their best condition like in the photo or get broken after being used for 30 days, just let us know. We sincerely apologize and will definitely send you the new ones in no time. We appreciate all your remarks and comments. They are the key tools to develop and improve our handmade and heartcrafted products.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81JPnC7zTKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FAAY","source_asin":"B08XVW7WM3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-741196","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08XVW7WM3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08XVW7WM3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
