window.products.push({"id":741233,"name":"The Oliver Gal Artist Co. Fashion and Glam Wall Art Canvas Prints 'Fashion Chart'","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":84.28,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81sSeBdWRiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Captivating contemporary black and white fashion and glam canvas wall art for living room and other interiors featuring stunning and stylish wall decor. Luxury fashion wall art to set the tone! Get it Fast and Flawless Our luxury wall art is carefully wrapped with a layer of shrink-wrap that protects the surface and then wrapped with heavy-duty bubble wrap. Shipped inside a double-layered cardboard box, ensuring its safe arrival to its new home. Let Your Walls Speak Fashion From iconic fashion brands, logo art, shoes, and handbags prints and your favorite haute designers to exclusive makeup and fashion essentials, these art pieces add glamour and sophistication to any decorative style in your home and office. Choose your canvas wall art for living room and let it stand out on its own or create your own fashion gallery wall. Perfect for Any Room Our pieces make the perfect living room, office or bathroom wall decor with many designs that can make a small space feel refreshed and a large space feel elegant and chic. Easy and Secure Hanging Includes all necessary hanging hardware, you’ll have your chic fashion piece secured on the wall in minutes! Decorate Like a Celebrity Oliver Gal is renowned for its wall art fashion designs and has been featured by numerous publications including People, Cosmopolitan Magazine, Seventeen Magazine, US Magazine, Reader's Digest, Vogue, and InStyle. Awarded American Quality and Design These canvas prints wall art piece is pridefully designed and manufactured in the USA by real artists and award-winning designers and includes a certificate of authenticity by the artist. Support a Women-Owned Business Oliver Gal is a lifestyle brand spearheaded by sisters and artists Lola and Ana, devoted to bringing you exclusive art pieces created to capture life's most haute moments. Long Lasting, Maintenance Free So easy to maintain, doesn’t require any cleaning liquids or water, just use a soft dust brush to gently remove dust when needed.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81sSeBdWRiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The Oliver Gal Artist Co.","source_asin":"B085HFQYVQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-741233","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B085HFQYVQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B085HFQYVQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":741234,"name":"Zanzer 6 Sides Stainless Steel Box Super Sharp Grater Fine, Medium, and Coarse for Hard Cheese, Parmesan & Slicer for Vegetable, Potatoes, Carrots Gin","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71prlJyputL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"When it comes times to great you favorite cheese, slice soft vegetables or make shavings to garnish your food, the Zanzer 6-Sided Cheese Grater will meet your needs . The hexagonal-sided design provides you with a variety of customized shred thickness to meet all your needs, designed to deliver quality results through a smooth grating experience . Manufactured using 18/8 stainless steel for long-term durability, this grater boasts six graters in one . Each side is furnished with super sharp grating textures , designed for fine, medium and coarse grating, as well as slicing and zesting . It’s an essential tool in any kitchen to shred a wide variety of edibles. The large, plastic handle fits comfortably in your hand, furnishing a sturdy grip for efficient and effortless shredding . To use, simply rest the non-slip base against a plate, firrnly grip the comfortable top handle, and enjoy high volume shredding in an instant. Grate vegetables and blocks of cheese. Shred or slice vegetables, like cabbage, cucumber and carrots. Finely grate nutmeg, lemon zest, garlic or parmesan. If you’re making a salad, you can shave small vegetable ribbons or cheese to top your salad. Making your favorite desert? Create chocolate ribbons to garnish and enhance that sumptuous, tasty treat. You can do all that with this box grater and so much more. Perfect for those who love to cook in the kitchen, this Zanzer 6-Sided Cheese Grater will make a great, practical gift for birthdays, wedding showers and other special occasions. It’s available in red and black to complement different tastes and is easy to clean with soap and water or by placing in the top rack of dishwasher. Bon appétit!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71prlJyputL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Zanzer","source_asin":"B07DRMQPFJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-741234","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07DRMQPFJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07DRMQPFJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
