window.products.push({"id":741277,"name":"YnM Kids Weighted Blanket — Organic Long Stapled Cotton Material with Premium Glass Beads (Strawberry , 36''x48'' 5lbs), Suit for One Person(~40lb) Us","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61LbUn7E+gL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Cotton [Innovative Design] The 7-layer system design adapts to the curve of your body for optimal comfort and the 4x4-inch smaller sections allow for more equitable weight distribution. It includes more glass beads and less fiberfill for enhanced temperature regulation. In addition, a three-dimensional lock bead stitching method prevents leaking of beads. It has the finest stitching (0.25mm per stitch) to avoid movement of weight between compartments. [Unique Sleeping Experience] YnM provides a natural means of calming the body for a good night's sleep. It is a wonderful sensory blanket for adults and children to help them relax and feel at ease. Great gifts for your loved ones. [Sizing Guide] To get the appropriate size for one child, take 10% of the body weight and add 1 pound. [Easy Care] Machine washable in a gentle setting. Tumble dry on a low setting or line dry. Use a mild detergent and avoid bleach. If you use YnM weighted blanket with a duvet cover, then you can just wash the light weight duvet cover instead of washing the heavy inner weighted blanket. [Reminder] Weighted blankets are not meant to hang off the edge of your bed. This concentrates weight into the areas where it is needed most. On you! So a weighted blanket is much smaller than an ordinary blanket.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61LbUn7E+gL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"YnM","source_asin":"B08CV6MF9Z","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-741277","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08CV6MF9Z","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08CV6MF9Z","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
