window.products.push({"id":741294,"name":"Critical Hit d20 Ice Mold - Chocolate or Soap","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/411GPEJdL8L._AC_.jpg","description":"The Temple of Elemental Tastiness When we started our tabletop roleplaying adventures, the beverage of choice was Mountain Dew. It still is sometimes in marathon sessions, but generally we now prefer something a little harder. Something our new characters might order in the tavern they just all happen to be in at the same time, for instance. Next time you're making drinks for your gaming group, add a d20 to the mix with this Critical Hit d20 Ice Mold. We're looking forward to filling it with something swirly to see if we can come up with something like our favorite dice. Fair warning: you're going to need to either order a few of these or start making early, cause everybody at the table's going to want one once they see your drink come out with a big ol' d20 plunked in the middle. To freeze: Fill bottom half of mold up to seam. Put top half of mold on (match notches). When frozen, remove from freezer. WITHOUT removing the top, fill the rest of the way (but leave a little space) and put back in freezer. Because of the magic of water molecules (and how they expand when frozen), this method prevents it the mold from leaking. To unmold: Remove the cap. With your fingers at the edges and your thumbs at the base of the mold, push your thumbs out while peeling the mold back with your fingers. You might be tempted to run water over the mold to loosen it, but resist that urge! Keep working it out, and you'll get a perfect icy d20, plus 100xp so you can work towards your paragon levels.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/411GPEJdL8L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Critical Hit","source_asin":"B00HL68SDC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-741294","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00HL68SDC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00HL68SDC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":741295,"name":"10oz clean burning FRESH SPRING LILAC | 100% all natural soy | phthalate + lead free | hand poured luxury soy wax | poured in Michigan | highly scente","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71H2dRyak6L._SL1242_.jpg","description":"Our candles are hand poured in our studio on the shores of Lake Michigan with our daughter Grace who happens to have Down syndrome. We work side by side to curate clean and highly scented candles that are safe for our home and yours. Scent of Fresh Spring Lilac This is one of our best sellers. Imaging your grandmas lilac bushes as a child. This candle burning or sitting cold on your coffee table will make you think you have a fresh cut bouquet of lilacs. It is the most realistic lilac in a candle we have ever found. Our goal is to provide clean burning candles. Each candle is poured with 100% soy wax, cotton wick and scented with phthalate free essential oils. Our candles are highly scented so you will be able to enjoy the scent while burning and while it is cold. 9 oz candles burn approx 80 hours","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71H2dRyak6L._SL1242_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The Grace Effect","source_asin":"B08VWXJ9QJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-741295","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08VWXJ9QJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08VWXJ9QJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
