window.products.push({"id":741381,"name":"H&W Rose Wreaths for Front Door Décor, 15'' Springtime Silk Flower Wreath, Garland for Window Wall Party Wedding Valentines Day Hanging Decorations (M","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ZS3LElF8L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"【H&W WREATH】 We focus on supply high quality party decoration and festival decoration products.Customer's satisfaction is the most important purpose for us.We are so certain that rose wreath will make you party perfect that we offer a 30 day no-questions-asked refund policy. Buy from us with ease, confidence and no hassle return!!Bright colors and lush greenery atop a lovely base make this wreath a wonderful addition to your home. Features soft cream yellow & white color roses accented with eucalyptus leaves and small berry surrounded by greenery. If you are looking for a beautiful wreath that will give your front door extra curb appeal for spring and summer, then this is the wreath for YOU!The rose wreath is suitable as indoor wreath, front door wreath, outdoor wreath, christmas wreath, halloween wreath, wedding wreath, baby shower door wreath, welcome wreath, spring wreath, etc. This decorative door wreath also suit for sitting room, hotel, wedding scene, wedding car, villa decoration, photography background etc.Features:1.Simple elegant and comfortable color, vivid natural form, create artistic romantic environment. This is a very full wreath with soft cream yellow & white color roses.2.Each wreath is handmade with high attention to detail and workmanship for design quality you can't find in retail stores.3.Beautiful and fully realistic looking leaves and flowers. Nice array of colors and textures.4.The spring front door wreath is a very well received gift no matter if it is a housewarming gift for your favorite someone or a mothers day wreath for mom.5.Environmental friendly material, nontoxic, odour-free, exquisite and durable.6.This colorful wreath is surrounded by plump flowers, simple elegant and comfortable color, vivid natural form,giving people artistic romantic feelings.7.Suitable for hanging in the door, window, bedroom and living room walls, wedding, christmas decoration.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ZS3LElF8L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"H&W","source_asin":"B089QHZJJD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-741381","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B089QHZJJD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B089QHZJJD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":741382,"name":"Set of 4 - Tea Coaster Golden Beaded Home Decorations Indian","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81awnpSsy-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Skilled artisans of Haryana in north India have crafted these beaded placemats. You can see the high level of workmanship in these mats. Unlike most other mats sold in the market, these mats are more densely woven on an underlying polyester fabric. This makes the mats more robust and the beads do not fall off easily. These mats are therefore last much longer. The mats are also in very elegant color shades. You would be proud to lay them on the dining table whenever you invite your friends and family to your home.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81awnpSsy-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Shalinindia","source_asin":"B00ADGP78Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-741382","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00ADGP78Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00ADGP78Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":741383,"name":"Folding Chair V-Tip Stabilizer Caps (100 Pack) - Fits 7/8\" OD Tube, Top of Leg - Replacement Parts Works with Metal and Padded Chairs Gray","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":54.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71JKaQNUR3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Our replacement 7/8 inch stability caps, also known as V-Tips, are designed to fit most all steel and padded or upholstered folding chairs. These type of chairs have a tubular steel frame with a measurement of approximately 7/8 inch outside diameter. These caps fit OVER the frame. Folding chairs are usually produced either using a cap type stabilizer that goes over the tube, or a plug type insert that goes inside the tube. Users will want to use the same type of stabilizer that came on your folding chair. If you are in need of the PLUG type of stabilizer or insert, we suggest you search for \"folding chair stability plug\" to see our other listing for that type. Make sure to measure the diameter of your chair frame prior to ordering.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71JKaQNUR3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Creative Play","source_asin":"B07ZZL3KZM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-741383","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07ZZL3KZM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07ZZL3KZM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
