window.products.push({"id":741476,"name":"Juicer, Picberm Centrifugal Juicer Machines Easy to Clean, 3”Wide Feed Chute Juice Extractor with Peeler, Brush & Recipes for Whole Fruits and Vegetab","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61tYgoPAn9L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":">>>【WHY CHOOSE PICBERM JUICER】Picberm centrifugal juicer can extract more nutrients from the fruits and veggies, and achieve higher juice yield at the same time. Faster speed makes the juicing process more efficient so you can enjoy the fresh juice in seconds. Made of BPA-free material and comes with juice recipes, peeler, user manual, juice container and cleaning brush, from food preparation to the cleaning process after juicing, our juicer meets all your needs. >>>【EXTRA LARGE CHUTE & DUAL-SPEED FUNCTION】3” feed chute accepts many kind of whole fruits and veggies without cutting them. 2-speed control can extract juice easily from various fruits and vegetables. \"1\" lower speed rotates at a speed around 16000 to 18000 RPM for softer food like oranges, grapes and berries, \"2\" faster speed rotates at a speed around 18000 to 20000 RPM for harder food like celery, ginger, carrots and apples. \"P\" is a manual setting that runs at high speed. >>>【EASY TO CLEAN & ANTI-DRIP DESIGN】Straightforward install design allows you to take apart or assemble the juicer is seconds. Anti-drip can prevent juice from being wasted and keep the table clean. With the cleaning brush you can clean up all the corners of the juicer parts easily, you can also use the dishwasher to clean the detachable parts too. >>>【SAFT AND STABLE OPERATION 】Double sides safety locks can keep the cover tightly closed while operating. The adsorption silicone feet at the bottom of the machine can maintain the stability of operation and also conduce to heat dissipation. Only when all parts are installed properly will the juicer start running. Overheat automatic shutdown system ensures your safety while in use and prolongs the service life of the machine. 【GUARANTEE & SERVICE】This product comes with a 2-year warranty. Also, we will provide you lifelong technical support and customer service. If you have any issue about the juicer, please contact us first, we will offer you a satisfactory solution as soon as possible!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61tYgoPAn9L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"picberm","source_asin":"B07Y8487HF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-741476","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07Y8487HF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07Y8487HF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
