window.products.push({"id":741582,"name":"Premium Quality Meal Prep Lunch Bag-Sturdy double insulated lunch box perfect for on the go meals to help you reach you fitness goals","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/714OixozdeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Are your diet and fitness goals suffering because of your active lifestyle? Achieving a healthy lifestyle is more than just going to the gym and working out. As a rule of thumb, weight loss and muscle gain are generally 75% diet and 25% exercise. This might seem easier than you think, but maintaining a balanced diet is more difficult than your fitness grind. This becomes a challenge when you’re too busy conquering your day. Eating a proper meal is hard enough with all the unhealthy options you’ll encounter. Plus, one lunchbox is not enough to keep all the food you need to consume for the day. Conquer your day and achieve your fitness goals with PhoenixFit’s Meal Prep Bags! Our sturdy and lightweight meal prep bag can accommodate your healthy meals and snacks that you’ve meticulously prepared. Each bag comes with adjustable dividers, three 1100 ml containers, a protein shaker bottle, pill box organizer, and 2 non-toxic ice packs. You can now feed your gains with a single reach, no matter where you are. Our meal prep bags are ideal for people like you who have a dynamic lifestyle. We carefully designed our bags for compact and portable use. They are made from high-density food-grade nylon for exceptional toughness and have convenient shoulder straps. Moreover, they are roomy but don’t look bulky. . Still not convinced? Here are more features to help you make a decision: ✅ Air-tight and double insulated containers with 4 snaps to keep your food’s temperature and freshness ✅ BPA-Free & Reusable ✅ Perfect gift idea","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/714OixozdeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PhoenixFit","source_asin":"B07HL468XR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-741582","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07HL468XR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07HL468XR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
