window.products.push({"id":741754,"name":"3pcs Matcha Tea Set, Japanese Matcha Etiquette Accessories with Bamboo Whisk, Ceramic Whisk Holder and Bamboo Teaspoon, Plastic Storage Jar, Tradition","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61dacUt8F1L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Brewing and grinding matcha is an artistic process. For matcha lovers, is a good matcha whisk set is indispensable. The bamboo whisk made of natural bamboo can help you blend perfect matcha without lumps. The small and exquisite ceramics matcha whisk can also effectively protect the shape of the bamboo whisk. 🛒You Will Get: 🧡1*Bamboo Whisk 💛1*Ceramic Whisk Holder 💙1*Bamboo Tea Spoon 💚1*Plastic Storage Tank 🌻product material: 👉 Whisk, Tea Spoon: bamboo products 👉Whisk Holder: ceramics 👉Storage tank: plastic 👏Use Tips: 🔶Before use, soak the tip of the matcha whisk in warm water for a short time to soften the bristles and not break easily. 🔷 When in use: When stirring matcha, please be careful not to apply pressure to avoid damaging the bristles. 🔶After use: wash with cold or warm water. Note the matcha whisk is made of bamboo and has delicate bristles.Do not wash with fierce water Please treat them gently. After washing, you can gently shake off the excess water aplace it on the ceramic ceramics whisk holder and let it dry. 🔔Note: 👋 Do not put the wet bamboo whisk into the container, it will easily cause mold. 👋 Since the bamboo matcha whisk is a bamboo product, do not soak it in water for a long time. It will change color after washing with warm water for many times, which is normal and does not affect the use. 📝 If you have any questions, please feel free to contact us, our customer service team will answer you and solve your problems as soon as possible.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61dacUt8F1L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cytheria","source_asin":"B091T16JQV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-741754","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B091T16JQV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B091T16JQV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
