window.products.push({"id":741898,"name":"Danish Dough Whisk and Bread Lame Set Dough Scoring blade with 5 Replaceable Blades, 13\"dough hook for Cake Dessert Pizza Pastry lame bread tool","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51gOwt526tL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Would you like to take your bread-making to the next level? Do you want to improve your baking skills? With danish whisk large and bread lame cutter, you can mix dry and wet ingredients together easier and more efficient and create clean and beautiful scoring even if you are beginning bakers. In your free time, you can bake with your family and enjoy happy time with family.Why choose hand danish whisk for dough? Double holes design, 50% more efficient and easier than the one hole. Solid stainless steel that won't bend. Easy to clean, simply rinse and dry. Prevent overworking the gluten and creating tough baked products Whether stiff, heavy or delicate dough, soft batters, pancakes, muffin mix, pastries, pizza, cookies can be blended.Why do you need a lame bread knife? bread scoring lame is uniquely designed for artisan bread baker. Score the dough prior to baking to allow moisture and gases to release from the loaf, to properly expand in the oven without tearing the skin or crust and give your loaves a beautiful and professional appearance. Specification: dutch whisk for dough material: stainless steel + oak Bread lame material: stainless steel + beechwood Danisk whisk size: 13 inch x 3.1 inch with a handle of 9.8 inch length; Bread lame size: 7.5 x 1.7 inch.Package Included: 1 * Danish Dough whisk 1 * Bread Lame 5 * Replacement Blades 1 * Screwdriver 1 * Protective coverWarm Tips: *Please do not let children touch the bread lame knife. *Keep the edge of blade clean of dough. *Moisturizing the blade will bring out a clean cut. *Store away in a safe place with a protective cover after using the blade. *Hold the lame at a 30 degrees angle when cutting, this helps to create a nice opening of the crust during baking. Don't miss this chance of baking with family; click 'Add to Cart' now!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51gOwt526tL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JUTTIRA","source_asin":"B08B3KG19C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-741898","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08B3KG19C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08B3KG19C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
