window.products.push({"id":741942,"name":"Native American Smudge Kit with Genuine Healing Crystals","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81V7QjbWsHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Smudging is a sacred ritual used by Native Americans and other tribal peoples for thousands of years. It is a ceremony for the purpose of cleansing our energy fields and purification of our physical and spiritual bodies. This smudge kit comes complete with one genuine abalone shell with stand, one 4 inch bundle of grey sage, natural amethyst and quartz crystals and one hand painted turkey prayer feather. To smudge a room, light one end of the smudge stick and allow to burn a few moments, then fan the flames out with the feather so that the herbs are smoldering. It is the smoke we want to work with not the fire. Once it is smoldering, continue to fan the sage with the prayer feather. Walk clockwise while fanning the smoke into all areas of the room. Continue this until the room feels clean to you. Open doors and windows so that anything negative can be chased outside the dwelling. Extinguish smudge stick on to shell which may also be used as a holder. Crystals are powerful generators of energy. They simply enhance whatever is around them. Be sure to cleanse them by smudging with sage, washing off dust , placing them in the sun to recharge or soaking them in sea salt. They will not work as well if they are dusty and neglected. As with all natural elements please allow for imperfections. Directions are included.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81V7QjbWsHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Navajo","source_asin":"B00WV7ONE4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-741942","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00WV7ONE4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00WV7ONE4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":741943,"name":"RISEON Boho Hand Woven Contemporary Yellow Cotton Linen Fabric Pouf Cover Footstool Ottoman Poufs Unstuffed-Square Floor Cushion Footrest  Cover for L","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":31.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71rvECsARTL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"RISEON Boho Hand Woven Contemporary  Cotton Linen Fabric Pouf Cover Footstool Ottoman Poufs Unstuffed-Square Floor Cushion Footrest  Cover for Living Room, Bedroom and Under Desk  Pouffes, also known as ottomans, make a stunning home furnishing accessory and give great character to any room in your house.  This cotton pouffes have many practical uses from seats to footstools to decorative side tables.  Choose from an array of different colours. Material: Cotton Linen fabric  Measurements:17.7*17.7*11.8 inch when filled.  Notice:The poufs are shipped UNSTUFFED.  (1)You can buy polystyrene balls or cotton filling locally, or  (2)Stuff the pouf with old cushions, recycling old clothing and fabrics to using old plastic supermarket bags. We recommend you to fill the pouf with this eco-friendly way as mentioned above, and fill them in our Moroccan Pouffes.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71rvECsARTL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"YISSEN","source_asin":"B087BFGZDF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-741943","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B087BFGZDF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B087BFGZDF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":741944,"name":"Little Princess Baby Shower Table Decorations Signs - Centerpiece Decor Supplies for Girl Pink and Gold","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91A+ZM4ETGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Includes 4 baby shower signs to complete your little princess baby shower decor for girls. Made with easels on the backs for easy display - no need for frames or stands - made of sturdy cardboard. Featuring 4 different signs: Welcome Come On In, Help Yourself To Drinks, Card and Gift Table Here, Babies are Sweet Grab a Treat. Measures 9 by 7 inches. Perfect size for placing on table tops, or can be attached to walls for a decorative embellishment. Great way to guide guests, and add a unique touch to your special event. These pink and gold table signs will compliment your little princess baby shower decorations and supplies for girl.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91A+ZM4ETGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bella and Bentley Novelty","source_asin":"B08CPHNZF6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-741944","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08CPHNZF6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08CPHNZF6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":741945,"name":"Preserved Flowers Roses Gifts for Women Mom, Fresh Flowers Forever Roses with Long-Lasting, Flowers for Delivery Prime Flower Bouquets with LED Lights","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71CiEHYrQpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🫶[Romantic birthday gifts for women] Preserved Flowers are the perfect gift for any special occasion. These eternal flowers are carefully preserved using high-quality technology to maintain their natural beauty, texture, and softness. Unlike fresh flowers, Preserved Flowers stay vibrant and look beautiful for at least three years. They are a great gift for birthdays, Mother's Day, anniversaries, or any other special occasion for your loved one. 🫶[Surprise a loved one with rose gifts] Quickly! Show her some love with a rose in a glass dome! Light-up rose gifts are a great way to demonstrate appreciation, best wishes, love, passion, and romance. These are perfect Mother's Day gifts for her, girlfriends, wives, moms, and other women, as well as birthday gifts for the special ladies in your life. Consider an amazing flower rose gift for her mom or other women, such as preserved flower rose gift. These are not only great gifts for her, but lovely decorations for a living room, bedroom, or desk centerpiece. Engagement gifts also come in the form of glass dome roses. 🫶[Happy mothers day gift ideas] Preserved flowers are the perfect way to show your mother, grandmother, girlfriend, wife, sister, or any other woman in your life how much you care on special occasions like Mother's Day, Valentines Day, Christmas, or Thanksgiving Day. These real flowers have been expertly dried and treated to last longer than fresh flowers, making them a unique and thoughtful gift. You can find preserved flower bouquets to decorate her home with and show her how much you care. 🫶[Get well soon Gift] This personalized LED glass rose is the perfect gift for any special occasion! The rose flower is encased in a glass dome and illuminated by an LED strip light, powered by three AAA batteries (not included). The bright, warm lighting of the LED strip can be used to create a romantic atmosphere during the day or night. Not only is this glass rose beautiful for Valentine's Day, birthdays, and weddings, but it also makes for a lovely night light. 🫶[Quality Assurance] The rose flower will be carefully preserved and packaged in a beautiful 6.3-inch x 6.3-inch x 6.3-inch gift box, with a beautiful greeting card attached. If upon receipt of the product the glass is broken or the item is damaged, please contact us immediately for a free refund or replacement. If you are not satisfied with the product, please contact us immediately for a full refund.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71CiEHYrQpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Regalo Flor","source_asin":"B0BYDFVSP9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-741945","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BYDFVSP9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BYDFVSP9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
